r a replacement using the same nonce and calldata, after revalidating the persisted approvedSemanticsDigest. It marks paid only after proof of the exact successful finalized transaction matched to persisted signed bytes/hash, source, recipient, value and calldata; a recipient may forward ETH and its ending balance is not payment proof. Rejected recipient calls become quarantine liabilities without blocking the rest of a manifest; dust carry is durable and atomically consumed and written between cycles. Edge case: a crash between supplementary broadcast and finality, duplicate recipient, nonce collision, replacement with different calldata, changed approval digest, dropped broadcast, rejecting recipient, or dust replay cannot create a double payment or silently change either manifest. Selected native cycles use versioned manifests and payout plans that bind the frozen selection evidence. For each selected holder, allocate floor(distributablePool * directHkmnBalance / selectedBalanceTotal), preserving current native dust carry, gas reservation, authorization and quarantine rules. Do not port historical largest-remainder redistribution. Unselected holders receive no payment and accrue no payout liability for this cycle. A selected holder with a zero rounded allocation remains selected but produces no value transfer. Historical native plans and signed or finalized payments retain byte-identical contents and digest verification.",
+      "measurement": "Node tests cover restart at every main and supplementary payout boundary, durable signed-record recovery, approval-digest revalidation, exact finalized native transaction identity, value and successful execution, immutable manifests, the original snapshot and return source reused by a supplementary manifest, exactly-once supplementary transfers after restart, exactly one settlement and manifest per positionId across restart, an exact replay of the same sell request ID with identical evidence returning the identical settlement and manifest identifier, a sell request with a different request ID after the first accepted sell failing without creating or funding a second manifest, a second manifest attempted for the same position/return source failing, same-nonce-and-calldata replacement, receipt search for a dropped broadcast, wallet-wide nonce fencing, refusal fencing, rejecting-recipient quarantine with continuation, failed gas counted as cost rather than principal, and no automatic retry, redirect or WETH fallback for terminal REFUSED recipients, durable dust carry, and recipient counts through the verified feasibility envelope. Execute the actual native payout handler on an isolated local EVM for N=100,200,300,400,500,600 with more than N eligible holders and sufficient principal for positive allocations. Assert exactly one finalized payment per selected holder, no unselected payment, principal plus dust conservation, gas accounting, unique nonces and interruption recovery without duplicates. Separate zero-rounding tests assert selectedCount differs from payableRecipientCount without fabricated payments. No live wallet or mainnet broadcast is allowed for this acceptance evidence.",
